# Agent guide

This repository is {{ if .DisplayName }}{{ .DisplayName }}{{ else }}{{ .Container }}{{ end }}, the `{{ .Container }}` command of {{ .SoftwareSystem }}: one Go
program, scaffolded by theos with the `{{ .Standard }}` Standard. Build it to the
